    "detailed_description": "Help Hana, who has fallen into the world of abandoned toys, 'Toyland', return to the real world!!<br><br>If you defend at the right timing of the enemy's attack, you can parry, and you can create a command attack by combining weak and heavy mouse attacks.<br><br>Combine the attacks to defeat the toys and the boss King Crown that attack one, and listen to the story behind them!!<br><br>Toyland is a 3D back view hack and slash game where you advance while defeating the waves of enemies. Feel the cool action feeling in Toy Land!<br><br>Do you remember playing with your eldest son when you were little?<br>If you remember playing with toys, where are the older boys now?<br><br>Here is Toyland, a world of toys forgotten and abandoned by their owners!<br><br>- This game supports operation through a gamepad.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317390/extras/201ad6a731d7133130ad972e78482d5d.avif?t=1677939717\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317390/extras/7afc2455d26dba259ea58fe57c7534c1.avif?t=1677939717\" /></span>",
